{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-29","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","englishTitle":"If an odd number by multiplying an odd number make some number, the product will be odd.","book":9,"number":29,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.29","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.29/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":29,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-29@raw-a9819af58f8a1ea5","contentId":"euclid-9-29","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a9819af58f8a1ea5560c246391d96eb90dfe41e3a364a94a3cb9ad571cd3b436","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-29.statement","euclid-9-29.construction.1","euclid-9-29.proof.1","euclid-9-29.proof.2","euclid-9-29.conclusion","euclid-9-29.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-29.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-29","revisionId":"euclid-9-29@raw-a9819af58f8a1ea5","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"330a4dd5224f51a19836aa694018822937f413617a7a724a64efa5b94203983f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an odd number by multiplying an odd number make some number, the product will be odd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个奇数乘以一个奇数得出一个数字,则该产品将是奇数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-29.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-29","revisionId":"euclid-9-29@raw-a9819af58f8a1ea5","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2c250408da0e627d1ea31d06739173b9d214499ad511cad4bf2dcf9017d7f11f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the odd number A by multiplying the odd number B make C; I say that C is odd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将B乘以A乘以C,我说C是奇数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-29.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-29","revisionId":"euclid-9-29@raw-a9819af58f8a1ea5","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"44f71ed68b5793e57155ca8eb29f991fdc4aabd5ee114bda61b2bde4fd620e23","citations":["euclid-7-def-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A by multiplying B has made C, therefore C is made up of as many numbers equal to B as there are units in A. [[VII. Def. 15](/principles/euclid-7-def-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,A乘以B, 已经组成C, 因此C由B和A的单位组成。 [[VII. Def. 15](/principles/euclid-7-def-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-29.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-29","revisionId":"euclid-9-29@raw-a9819af58f8a1ea5","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ea8b3209ba2267098774bc33edae1c9021ebbc7bc50a2c03878838c9ed67be2f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And each of the numbers A, B is odd; therefore C is made up of odd numbers the multitude of which is odd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B数字中每个数字都很奇怪, 因此C数字是由奇数组成的, 其数量之多是奇数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-29.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-29","revisionId":"euclid-9-29@raw-a9819af58f8a1ea5","order":4,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e00b0f11bb91b57c333ec1945400920c78c12319617a877b592e90f7fd57ada8","citations":["euclid-9-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus C is odd. [[IX. 23](/principles/euclid-9-23)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C是奇数 证毕。 [[IX. 23](/principles/euclid-9-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-29.source","contentId":"euclid-9-29","revisionId":"euclid-9-29@raw-a9819af58f8a1ea5","order":5,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a879a064893560d7a533bbfa8d00513372f5014650f94c414577e0a5373b8d83","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.29/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.29\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-29:euclid-7-def-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-29","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-29.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.29","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.29/","sourceLabel":"VII. Def. 15"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-29:euclid-9-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-29","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-29.conclusion"],"targetContentId":"euclid-9-23","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.29","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.29/","sourceLabel":"IX. 23"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:eucl